Priority: optional
Maintainer: kaylor <kaylor@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: kaylor-input
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-flask, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xdotool, xclip, wl-clipboard, ydotool
Description: LAN text input relay tool
 Open a web page on your phone, type text, press Send, and the
 text is pasted at the cursor on your Linux desktop.
 .
 Auto-detects X11 or Wayland and uses the appropriate paste method.
 Access from any device on the same LAN via http://<ip>:5000.
